  "description": "Material Design 3 theme for the WA.Core Blazor UI, made to look like Google's own apps: top app bar with the main menu as one M3 menu, account menu, outlined text fields with floating labels, filled / tonal / outlined buttons, dialogs, snackbars and menus of M3 Expressive, Google Sans and Material Symbols served locally. 12 colour themes (Google blue by default) in light, dark or auto (follows the OS) and three contrast levels, switchable by the user. An Aether-compatible kit, the shared FViewer markup and a library of native Blazor M3 components (buttons, icon buttons, FAB, chips, cards, lists, menus, tabs, sliders, progress indicators, badges, steppers, date / time pickers, side and bottom sheets, navigation rail and bar). Styles from MICL (MIT); no Bootstrap, no jQuery, no theme JavaScript. Built on SI.WA.UI.Core.",
  "id": "SI.WA.UI.Material3",
  "isPrerelease": false,
  "lastEdited": "2026-10-13T18:55:44.97Z",
