  "packageHash": "ItEyTwTUbuZ82lVX+um+lXFwEObX1+8CaI3hQGYYiS+jEHHZeYZ4VvKk4QmYLyemoJ5CPzyds9n7Jjk+IMIRhg==",
  "packageHashAlgorithm": "SHA512",
  "packageSize": 1862401,
  "published": "2026-10-13T17:19:14Z",
  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "1.5.0 -- Login: the external-login buttons (Google / Facebook / Microsoft) use paths relative to the base href, so they work under a PathBase (IIS_AppName). Requires SI.WA.UI.Core 1.5.0. Forms: a field with a tooltip shows its title again (the kit's labels rendered the info icon instead of the title, now the title followed by the icon). Grid: the header cells of frozen columns (<cell fixed=\"left|right\">) stay above the other header cells and the frozen body cells, so the top-left title cell is no longer overlapped while the grid scrolls. 1.4.1 -- Grid: per-value cell colours from CustomClass.xml (class / style on the cell); the CSV / Excel export button opens the WA_GridExport wizard. Card: body-key=\"@KEY\" / \"@Field\" shows a 'save first' note while the parent record is new and reloads the body form when the parent gets its key. Requires SI.WA.UI.Core 1.4.0. 1.3.0 -- First release, requires SI.WA.UI.Core 1.3.0. Material Design 3 (M3 Expressive) theme on the CSS of MICL: Google-style shell (top app bar with the main menu as one M3 menu, account menu), 12 colour themes in light / dark / auto and three contrast levels with a theme switcher, an Aether-compatible kit drawn as M3 components, the shared FViewer markup, Data Management, and a library of M3 components (M3Button, M3TextField, M3Chip, M3Slider, M3Tabs, M3DatePicker ...) for new pages. No theme JavaScript.",
